    'Neural Synapse links', 'Bespoke Chronometers', 'Graphene Fiber Vests', 'Autonomous Drone Nodes', 'Pneumatic Pistons',
    'Cyber City Access Keys', 'Obsidian Carbon Plating', 'Sub-Zero Vapor Coolers', 'Quantum Core Nodes', 'High-Contrast Visors',
    'Fluid-Cell Injectors', 'Sub-Dermal Implants', 'Bionic Limb Sockets', 'Sonic Wave Dampeners', 'Graphene Weave Coats',
